  "merchantBadge": {
    "$comment": "Letter badge derived from a transaction description (no logos, nothing sent anywhere). key = first word of the normalized description that is not a filler word and not only digits; letter = its first character, upper-cased; colour = palette[fnv1a32(utf8(key)) % palette.length]. Normalization: lower-case, every run of characters that are not letters, combining marks or digits -> one space (so Devanagari vowel signs stay inside their word), trim.",
